WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Find App ID and App Secret in Credentials & Basic Info. Keep the secret private.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Add the Bot capability to your company-built app. This example is already configured.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Use Tenant token scopes for the application. Start with mentions; request all-group access only if needed.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Enable im:message:send_as_bot to reply as the application bot.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Settings → IM Bots → Feishu → Manual setup. Choose international Lark and enter credentials privately.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Confirm the account is online. BotHarness updates the qualified Provider together with the product.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Choose persistent connection. If the console requires an active connection, connect locally first.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Subscribe to im.message.receive_v1 with the application identity. Other events here are not required for this guide.

9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Publish a version and obtain required approval. The example shows Released. Add the bot to your test group.

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Open the account settings → Delivery targets. Test and save the intended group.

11
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
In the PersonaBot Profile, bind your connected application identity. Each Bot uses its own identity.

12
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Authorize this exact group. Start with Inbox-only and mentions-only intake.

13
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Mention the bot in Lark. Open Bot Inbox → group → processed messages → source details; verify the reply in Lark.
